  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Diodes Incorporated (DIOD) Plano, TX, USA Fourth Quarter 2025 Financial Results February 10, 2026 Exhibit 99.2</font></p>
  <hr style="margin-inline-start:auto;margin-inline-end:auto;page-break-after:always;">
